  "description": "Cattura SDK — Zebra AI DataCapture SDK for .NET MAUI and .NET for Android.\n      Provides barcode decoding (44+ symbologies) and OCR text recognition on Zebra devices\n      via the Zebra AI DataCapture SDK 4.1.0 (Android 13 or later).\n\n      For production: pass the JWT license issued by Suntech to CatturaScanner.Initialize().\n      For evaluation: pass the string \"DEMO\" (results partially obfuscated with asterisks).\n\n      Includes transitive dependencies: Kotlin stdlib, CameraX, AndroidX.",
